{
  "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "wuzibei",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "xujinghe"
  ],
  "weightless": true,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "夜里看无印碑样，放下笔后才进入结局",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "夜里石旁没有印，灯照着一张空的碑样纸，纸角被风吹得贴上石面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l2",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "压住这边，别让它飞。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l3",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你用笔杆压住纸角，石的冷透进指腹，手没有立刻收回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "以后不刻颂辞，先留这一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里只是碑样。我也可以看一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l6",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可以看。温那册子仍在她手里，这张只给你看留白的尺寸，不替谁搬来私页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l7",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "有人已经把自己的取走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l8",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就由她取走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l9",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你提起笔，纸角又翻过来，露出一样空的背面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l10",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我不写满，她们也不会少一处说话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l11",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你留空，她们也得留空么？有人愿记，有人不愿；谁还欠你的字，须另问本人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l12",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（又说她们。连这张白纸，也想一并答了。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l13",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将笔尖抬离纸面，墨还挂在尖上，没有落下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l14",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那今晚先这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l15",
      "who": "xujinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "灯还能放一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s18_wuzibei.l16",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把笔放下。"
    }
  ],
  "judgeEnding": true
}
